{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NEH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"尼希米记","commonName":"尼希米记","title":"尼希米记","order":16,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"df2302cd95811b185c2d5ceed29a0e326db0fe88bea139e34d3089f62ac641f2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NEH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NEH/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["尼希米关心耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["哈迦利亚的儿子尼希米的言语如下： 亚达薛西王二十年基斯流月，我在书珊城的宫中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，有我一个弟兄哈拿尼，同着几个人从犹大来。我问他们那些被掳归回、剩下逃脱的犹大人和耶路撒冷的光景。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们对我说：「那些被掳归回剩下的人在犹大省遭大难，受凌辱；并且耶路撒冷的城墙拆毁，城门被火焚烧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我听见这话，就坐下哭泣，悲哀几日，在天上的 神面前禁食祈祷，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「耶和华—天上的 神，大而可畏的 神啊，你向爱你、守你诫命的人守约施慈爱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["愿你睁眼看，侧耳听，你仆人昼夜在你面前为你众仆人以色列民的祈祷，承认我们以色列人向你所犯的罪；我与我父家都有罪了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们向你所行的甚是邪恶，没有遵守你借着仆人摩西所吩咐的诫命、律例、典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["求你记念所吩咐你仆人摩西的话，说：『你们若犯罪，我就把你们分散在万民中；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但你们若归向我，谨守遵行我的诫命，你们被赶散的人虽在天涯，我也必从那里将他们招聚回来，带到我所选择立为我名的居所。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["这都是你的仆人、你的百姓，就是你用大力和大能的手所救赎的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["主啊，求你侧耳听你仆人的祈祷，和喜爱敬畏你名众仆人的祈祷，使你仆人现今亨通，在王面前蒙恩。」",{"text":"我是作王酒政的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NEH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NEH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZR/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}